        "code": {
          "text": "Complex regional pain syndrome of the right foot, with ongoing flare of hyperaesthesia and allodynia"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Known CRPS following a fifth metatarsal fracture approximately 7 months ago. Current flare is functionally limiting. No clinical evidence of infection, DVT, or new radiculopathy; no alternative diagnosis suggested clinically."
